 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONSTRUCTION, EXPENSES &amp; THE BLACK MARKET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new wings, upgrade cells, buy and sell favors, and streamline the flow of the condemned. Remember: a prison that doesn\u2019t pay is just a charity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/797e6b2bfb6d24a93036c58b6d965078.poster.avif?t=1750323776\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/797e6b2bfb6d24a93036c58b6d965078.webm?t=1750323776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776810/extras/797e6b2bfb6d24a93036c58b6d965078.mp4?t=1750323776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detective puzzles with bizarre evidence and unreliable witnesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full prison management: from building cells to crushing riots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Execution methods with upgrades and dramatic flair</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark humor, absurd situations, and total moral freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Economy vs ethics: you decide what\u2019s worth more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ready to decide who lives and who fries? Your guillotine is polished and waiting.</i></strong></p>",
